<title>USA: TABLE - American Restaurant Partners Lp Q2.</title>
<headline>TABLE - American Restaurant Partners Lp Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr unit loss	    $0.03   profit	 $0.20</p>
<p> Net loss		     119   profit	   790</p>
<p> Revs			10,004		    9,888</p>
<p> Avg unit		     815			815</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Unit results represent net income per income preference unit. Cash distribution per income preference unit was $0.11 in '97 Q2 vs $0.26 in '96 Q2.  </p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr unit loss   $0.06	 profit   $0.37</p>
<p> Net loss	  245	   profit   1,488</p>
<p> Revs		19,623		   19,744</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  815			815</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: '97 six mos cash distribution per income preference unit $0.22 vs $0.42 in '96 six mos.</p>
<p>'96 Q2 and six mos includes $157,867 gain on fire settlement.</p>
<p>	  ((--Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
